  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/docs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: latex.py:449 still overrides analyze() wholesale. analyze_latex() on a 2-file fixture (one file with tree.has_error=True) gives run.pass_version='' and failed_files=[]; \\ref{sec:intro} edge is 'a.tex:file -> sec:intro'; the labels arg of _extract_edges_from_file is never read. Premise holds. The edge-endpoint half is the same defect INV-zipaj (filed 10-17) describes in more detail; suggest this item keep the run-bookkeeping half. MECHANISM: analyzer overrides TreeSitterAnalyzer.analyze() with a private loop, skipping base bookkeeping (pass_version stamping, record_partial_parse) and canonical id helpers. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-zipaj."  # b952
